{"id":"20d69bde348c5967","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Filtration","display":"df-zfc-prob2-filtration — ZFC Prob2 Filtration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-filtration — ZFC Prob2 Filtration","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-filtration — ZFC Prob2 Filtration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I,I,\\Omega\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I,I,\\Omega\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\">\\(\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the sigma-algebra, linear-order, and function predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}filtration} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists I,\\leq_I,\\Omega\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\Omega)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(j))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}filtration} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists I,\\leq_I,\\Omega\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\Omega)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(j))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97a